OL,3,GNEWSADecision to close care homes to go
OL,4,Aback to Cabinet                        
OL,6,FA decision to close a local authority's
OL,7,Fcare homes will go back to its cabinet 
OL,8,Ffor further discussion.                
OL,10,FAt a meeting of the Adult social care, 
OL,11,Fhealth and communities overview and    
OL,12,Fscrutiny committee on Monday,          
OL,13,Fcouncillors voted in favour of the     
OL,14,Fdecision being reconsidered.           
OL,16,FEarlier this month, Reform UK-run West 
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Council approved      
OL,18,Fproposals to reshape several           
OL,19,Fcouncil-run provisions, affecting 250  
OL,20,Fpeople, including 81 who live in       
OL,21,FSouthfields House and Obelisk House    
OL,22,Fcare homes in Northampton.             
